# Copy to `.env`. Path to Ableton Live's Extension Host so `npm start` /
# `extensions-cli run` can connect. The official project creator fills this in.
#
# macOS  — the Live app bundle:
EXTENSION_HOST_PATH=/Applications/Ableton Live 12.x Beta.app
# Windows — the Live .exe or install root, e.g.:
# EXTENSION_HOST_PATH=C:\ProgramData\Ableton\Live 12.x Beta\Program\Ableton Live 12.x Beta.exe
#
# You can also skip .env and pass --live to the CLI:
#   npx extensions-cli run --live "/Applications/Ableton Live 12.x Beta.app"
